From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhugengyu <zhugengyu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] sdio: (recv) Publish the receive presentation for the
 census

The receive path is the only place that sees the card's own answer to
"how much is pending" (SDIO_REG_RX0_REQ_LEN) and the read that answers
it.  A stall that leaves the pump running and the receive buffers
healthy therefore has no reading that says whether the card stopped
offering work or the host stopped asking.

Publish the three events the driver alone can see - the offer, the read
completion, and the interrupt status about to be dispatched - through
the observation seam the image provides.  No control flow changes; the
calls are no-ops in an image built without the census.

Signed-off-by: zhugengyu <zhugengyu@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 hal/rtl8188f/sdio/sdio_ops.c | 16 +++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/hal/rtl8188f/sdio/sdio_ops.c
+++ b/hal/rtl8188f/sdio/sdio_ops.c
@@ -16,6 +16,8 @@
 
 #include <rtl8188f_hal.h>
 
+#include "lkpi_sdio_rx_probe.h"
+
 /* #define SDIO_DEBUG_IO 1 */
 #define CONFIG_RTW_SDIO_REG_FORCE_CMD52 0
 
@@ -1530,13 +1532,22 @@
 			#endif
 		}
 
+		/* the card's own answer, published before the read it drives */
+		lkpi_sdio_rx_note_offer(phal->SdioRxFIFOSize);
+
 		if (phal->SdioRxFIFOSize != 0) {
 			u32 ret;
 
 			#ifdef CONFIG_MAC_LOOPBACK_DRIVER
 			sd_recv_loopback(padapter, phal->SdioRxFIFOSize);
 			#else
-			ret = sd_recv_rxfifo(padapter, phal->SdioRxFIFOSize, &precvbuf);
+			{
+				u32 rx_want = phal->SdioRxFIFOSize;
+
+				ret = sd_recv_rxfifo(padapter, rx_want, &precvbuf);
+				lkpi_sdio_rx_note_read(rx_want,
+				    precvbuf ? rx_want : 0u, precvbuf ? 1 : 0);
+			}
 			if (precvbuf) {
 				sd_rxhandler(padapter, precvbuf);
 				phal->SdioRxFIFOSize = 0;
@@ -1573,6 +1584,9 @@
 	dvobj = adapter_to_dvobj(padapter);
 	pwrctl = dvobj_to_pwrctl(dvobj);
 
+	/* the status about to be dispatched, for the receive-presentation census */
+	lkpi_sdio_rx_note_hisr(phal->sdio_hisr);
+
 #ifdef CONFIG_SDIO_TX_ENABLE_AVAL_INT
 	if (phal->sdio_hisr & SDIO_HISR_AVAL) {
 		u8 freepage[8];
